7. **The `window.claude.hot` integration stays the same:** register `hot.snapshot(() => ({ x, z, zoom }))`, call `hot.ready(start)` if it exists, otherwise `start(hot.data || {})`. `start(saved)` must still restore the position and zoom with the same `isFinite` checks.
